        "body": "<p>Your skin carries its own microbiome, a community of microbes living on its surface. Published research suggests this community does better when skincare leaves it undisturbed. So we make every product slightly acidic (pH 5 to 5.5), close to the pH of healthy skin, and leave out synthetic fragrance and ingredients that strip. We also add a plant prebiotic that, in laboratory studies, feeds the skin's beneficial bacteria.</p>",
